Z||000000||Cozmo||04-22-2001||05:09 AM||||Spektyr brought up a curious point... <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/009818.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/009818.html</A>  item #3<BR>That got me wondering, I remember the old VW commercials about "floating" bugs.  Would the Fiero fare any better than the average car in the buoyancy department?<BR>(if it floats, it's a witch... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)<BR>C02M0||||reg||10
