Z||000008||Spektyr||04-22-2001||02:38 PM||||Everything I've heard suggests they average around 2500lbs.<P>And no, a Fiero would float about as well as Jimmy Hoffa.<P>What made my buddy think he was floating was that he turned the wheel and had no effect on the facing of the car in rather deep water at low speed.  In actuality I think he was just 'speed boating' the car a little... the water going under the very light front end of the car lifted it like a boat cruising on the water enough to reduce is front tire friction to almost nothing.<P>What he did accomplish was at least partially submerging the driver's side air vent and sucking water and crud into the air filter assembly, where it rusted and currently has me somewhat worried.  He did this last spring/summer, and has driven the car a lot since then.  It seems to run well now that I've got it, but the rust deposits leading from the air filter can into the intake hose have me a bit concerned.<P>Won't be happy till I get a look inside the intake manifold.<P>------------------<BR>85 GT (to be modified...)<BR>--Um, no the paint isn't oxidized, that's the ultra-rare Whirlpool White textured finish... yeah.<BR>89 Lincoln Town Car (has Fiero Envy)<BR>--Hey!  Can I have an anti-sway bar too?<p>[This message has been edited by Spektyr (edited 04-22-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000009||Galen||04-22-2001||03:07 PM||||Let me run out to my 88 and check right quick..<P>*runs outside in the nude*<P>I stand corrected. by alot, 3098lbs. whoa..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> hehe<P>------------------<BR>Galen - 1988 Hawaiian Orchid Coupe - <A HREF="http://myfiero.spinrpg.com/" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero Website</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.spinrpg.com/" TARGET=_blank>Spinrpg.com - Free URL & e-mail Forwarding</A>||||reg||1
Z||000010||Kelvin Vivian||04-22-2001||11:15 PM||||A while back FieroDave sold a gold 86 coupe on eBay that had been submerged, I think he sold it as a "parts car"... So at least we know that 86 coupes can't float.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
